target: mf repo load
summary: Load an existing repository, wait for its warmup and print its UUID

!! Reference

```
Load an existing repository, wait for its warmup and print its UUID

By its root, its --metafolder, or — with no path — by the name given with -n, among the repositories the daemon's configuration knows (`[[known]]`, `[[load]]`; `mf repo known` lists them).

Usage: mf repo load [OPTIONS] [ROOT]

Arguments:
  [ROOT]
          

Options:
      --metafolder <METAFOLDER>
          Load from an external .metafolder directory

      --no-wait
          Print the UUID immediately, without waiting for the warmup

      --in-memory
          Copy the store into memory and read it there, so that no read waits on the disk (every write still goes to the disk first)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
```
